      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nAdds `VLLM_RAY_PG_STRATEGY` to make the Ray placement group strategy configurable when vLLM creates a placement group.\r\n\r\nThe environment variable defaults to `PACK` to preserve the existing behavior and accepts:\r\n\r\n- `PACK`\r\n- `SPREAD`\r\n- `STRICT_PACK`\r\n- `STRICT_SPREAD`\r\n\r\nThe value is validated with the existing `env_with_choices()` helper and passed to `ray.util.placement_group()` in `initialize_ray_cluster`.\r\n\r\nFixes #49527.\r\n\r\n## Why this is not a duplicate\r\n\r\nBefore opening this PR, I checked open PRs referencing #49527, open PRs containing `VLLM_RAY_PG_STRATEGY`, and open PRs related to configurable Ray placement group strategy.\r\n\r\nI did not find an existing open PR implementing this feature.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nPassed locally:\r\n\r\n```text\r\npython -m py_compile vllm/envs.py vllm/v1/executor/ray_utils.py tests/test_envs.py\r\n```\r\n\r\nTargeted validation confirmed:\r\n\r\n- default strategy is `PACK`\r\n- `PACK`, `SPREAD`, `STRICT_PACK`, and `STRICT_SPREAD` are accepted\r\n- invalid values are rejected\r\n- `initialize_ray_cluster` uses `envs.VLLM_RAY_PG_STRATEGY`\r\n\r\nLint checks passed:\r\n\r\n```text\r\npre-commit run ruff-check --files vllm/envs.py vllm/v1/executor/ray_utils.py tests/test_envs.py\r\npre-commit run ruff-format --files vllm/envs.py vllm/v1/executor/ray_utils.py tests/test_envs.py\r\ngit diff --check\r\n```\r\n\r\nI was not able to run the full `pytest tests/test_envs.py` suite locally because the Windows environment does not have the full vLLM test dependency set installed. Test collection progressed past `tblib` and then stopped on the missing `regex` dependency. Repository CI will provide the full test-environment validation.\r\n\r\n## AI assistance\r\n\r\nAI tools were used for implementation assistance and code completion. All changes were manually reviewed and validated.",
